---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
// Placeholder (S1). It describes what the site does today; S5–S8 extend it as the portals and
// the optional live assistant arrive (SITE_PLAN §11).
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy"
  description="What this site collects (nothing on its own) and what third parties see."
>
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p class="lede">
      This site doesn’t collect anything about you on its own. This page will grow as the
      interactive parts arrive; it describes the site as it is today.
    </p>

    <h2>What this site does</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>No cookies, no analytics, no trackers, and no advertising.</li>
      <li>Fonts are served from this site, not from a font service.</li>
      <li>
        If you switch between the light and dark theme, your choice is saved in your own browser
        (localStorage) so the next page uses it. It never leaves your device.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What third parties see</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>GitHub Pages</strong> hosts the site. Like any web host, GitHub receives your IP
        address and browser details when you load a page; see{' '}
        <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">
          GitHub’s privacy statement
        </a>
        .
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>GitHub activity</strong> on the homepage is refreshed by your browser from GitHub’s
        public API (api.github.com), so GitHub sees that request too. The result is kept in your
        browser’s session storage for up to 30 minutes.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Videos</strong> load nothing from YouTube until you click play. Then the player
        loads from youtube-nocookie.com, and YouTube’s own policies apply.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>The CS-UDT demo</strong> loads map software and map tiles from outside services; the{' '}
        <a href="/demos/csudt/">demo page</a> lists them.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <p>
      The source of this site is public: you can check all of the above in{' '}
      <a href="https://github.com/nanjierao/nanjierao.github.io">its repository</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
